{"sha": "fd31ff9ef285ca6bb13c649d557aae505d254d6094eb2e12e3816628962214a0", "body": ["\\begin{example}[从河水中得到干净的水]\\label{ex:g3:separating-mixtures:plant}", "一座净水厂分几个步骤，使河水可以饮用：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 河水流经滤网，滤网是一些大格栅，能挡住", "        树枝、树叶和塑料，这是一种筛分；", "  \\item 河水流入大水池静置，泥沙沉到池底；", "  \\item 然后穿过厚厚的沙层过滤，沙层能拦住", "        最细小的颗粒；", "  \\item 再加入少量能杀灭细菌的物质，", "        使水在管道中保持安全。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, node distance=0.45cm,", "    box/.style={draw=omDef, fill=omDef!6, rounded corners=2pt, align=center,", "      minimum height=1.15cm, text width=2.0cm}]", "  \\node[box] (r) {河水};", "  \\node[box, right=of r] (s) {滤网\\\\ （筛分）};", "  \\node[box, right=of s] (t) {沉降池};", "  \\node[box, right=of t] (f) {沙滤池};", "  \\node[box, right=of f] (g) {细菌\\\\ 已杀灭};", "  \\foreach \\a/\\b in {r/s,s/t,t/f,f/g} \\draw[->, thick, omProp] (\\a) -- (\\b);", "  \\node[below=0.15cm of s, font=\\footnotesize, align=center] {树枝、\\\\ 塑料};", "  \\node[below=0.15cm of t, font=\\footnotesize, align=center] {泥沙};", "  \\node[below=0.15cm of f, font=\\footnotesize, align=center] {细小颗粒};", "  \\draw[->, thick, omProp] (g.south) -- ++(0,-0.8) node[below] {通往水龙头};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 净水厂的各个步骤。每一步下方为它去除的", "物质。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{minipage}[t]{0.48\\linewidth}\\centering", "\\includegraphics[width=\\linewidth,height=4.6cm,keepaspectratio]{images/book1/ai/g3-settling-tanks.jpg}", "", "{\\small 净水厂沉降池的照片。}", "\\end{minipage}\\hfill", "\\begin{minipage}[t]{0.48\\linewidth}\\centering", "\\includegraphics[width=\\linewidth,height=4.6cm,keepaspectratio]{images/book1/ai/g3-gold-panning.jpg}", "", "{\\small 淘金时，河水会把轻的沙子冲走；", "重的颗粒留在盘中。}", "\\end{minipage}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{remark}[清澈不等于干净]\\label{rem:g3:separating-mixtures:clean}", "经过过滤的水可能看上去十分清澈，但仍可能含有溶解的物质，", "以及小得肉眼看不见的细菌。", "因此即使经过过滤，也没有人会直接饮用池塘或溪流中的水。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:separating-mixtures:1}", "用哪种方法可以把豌豆和米粒分开？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:separating-mixtures:2}", "将一杯泥水放在桌上静置一小时，泥土会发生什么变化？", "这种现象叫做什么？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:separating-mixtures:3}", "什么是滤液？写出煮咖啡时得到的滤液。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:separating-mixtures:4}", "将盐水倒入滤纸中。滤液是咸的吗？", "请说明理由。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:separating-mixtures:5}", "如何从一杯糖水中把糖取回来？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:separating-mixtures:6}", "看一看筛子的图。哪些颗粒留在筛子里？", "为什么其他颗粒会漏下去？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:separating-mixtures:7}", "将每种混合物与一种方法配对 --- 筛分、过滤或蒸发：", "(a) 沙子和卵石；(b) 水中的粉笔粉；(c) 水中的食盐。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:separating-mixtures:8}", "看一看净水厂的图。水要经过几个步骤？", "哪一步去除了泥沙？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:separating-mixtures:9}", "将下列步骤排好顺序，以便从装有沙子、食盐和水的", "罐子中取回沙子和食盐：蒸发滤液；过滤；", "从滤纸上收集沙子。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:separating-mixtures:10}", "过滤能否使海水可以饮用？请解释为什么不能。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g3:separating-mixtures:11}", "茶壶里装满了茶水，茶叶留在其中。", "写出本章中两种能把茶水与茶叶分开的方法。", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}